<title>USA: NAPM's Kauffman says to leave post Jan 2, 1997.</title>
<headline>NAPM's Kauffman says to leave post Jan 2, 1997.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ralph Kauffman, chairman of the National Association of Purchasing Management's survey committee, said he will leave his post on January 2, 1997.  </p>
<p>Beginning January 2, 1997, Kauffman will be succeeded by Norbert Ore, who is currently a purchasing director for SONOCO Products Co.</p>
